{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "root",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# The One-Day Protocol\n\nAn interactive model of \"How to fix your entire life in 1 day\"\n\nIdeas: Dan Koe · Map: @MindBranches",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3350,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 135
  },
  {
   "id": "core-problem",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Core Problem**",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 190,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "cp-action-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Change fails at the action layer\n\nPeople swap behaviours while leaving their identity untouched, so the old self quietly reinstalls the old behaviour.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 135,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "cp-person-not-plan",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "You need the person, not the plan\n\nThe durable move is becoming someone for whom the desired actions are simply the obvious ones.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 161,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "cp-not-an-accident",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Your current life is not an accident\n\nToday's behaviour is already succeeding at goals you never consciously chose. That is exactly why it survives.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 301,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 135,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "principles",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Key Psychological Principles**",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 1450,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "identity-first",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Identity First, Actions Second**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 610,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "if-effort-symptom",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Effort is a symptom, not a strategy\n\nPeople who look like they are grinding are usually just living a life that fits them.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 462,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "if-lifestyle-before",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Adopt the lifestyle before the outcome\n\nLive as the person who already has the result. The result is what that life produces.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 581,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "if-misfit-repels",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Misfit habits should start to repel you\n\nOnce identity actually shifts, old habits stop feeling tempting and start feeling wrong.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 700,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "your-mind",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Understanding Your Mind**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 1037,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ym-teleological",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Behaviour is goal-directed\n\nNothing you do is random. Every pattern is aimed at something (teleology).",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 840,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ym-goals-against-you",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Some of those goals work against you\n\nYou can pursue a goal for years without ever having chosen it.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 959,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ym-change-the-goal",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Change the goal, not just the schedule\n\nNew perspective produces new goals, which produce new behaviour. In that order.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1078,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ym-identity-defends",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Identity defends itself\n\nYour sense of self reacts to contradiction the way your body reacts to infection.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1197,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "anatomy",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**The Anatomy of Identity**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 1485,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "an-loop",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The identity loop\n\nSet a goal, perceive reality through it, notice what is relevant, act and get feedback, repeat until automatic, it becomes \"who you are\", you defend it, and it starts generating your next goals.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1316,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 156,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "an-childhood",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "It started before you were consulted\n\nMost of the loop was installed in childhood by environment and conditioning.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1498,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "an-ideology",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "After survival comes ideology\n\nOnce the body is safe, you begin defending beliefs as if they were food and shelter.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1617,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "stages",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Stages of Mind Development**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 1874,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "st-where-most-are",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Most people sit between self-aware and construct-aware\n\nRoughly stages 4 to 8 in adult-development models.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1736,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "st-sequential",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Development is sequential\n\nYou cannot skip a stage. You can only move through the next one.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1855,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "st-upper",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The upper stages question inherited beliefs\n\nThat is where you stop borrowing principles and start writing your own.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 1974,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "intelligence",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Intelligence Framework**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 2290,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "in-definition",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Intelligence = getting what you actually want\n\nA working definition, not an IQ score.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 2093,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "in-ingredients",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Three ingredients: agency, opportunity, intelligence\n\nRemove any one of the three and results stall.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 2212,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "in-cybernetic",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The cybernetic loop\n\nSet a goal, act, sense where you are, compare to the goal, adjust. Then repeat.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 2331,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "in-iteration",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "High intelligence = iteration speed\n\nPersisting and learning from mistakes beats being right early.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 2450,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "protocol",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**The One-Day Protocol**",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 3987,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "part1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Part 1 — Morning: Psychological Excavation**\n\n15–30 minutes of honest writing, before the day gets loud.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 3171,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "anti-vision-q",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Anti-Vision Questions**",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 2920,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What dissatisfaction have you quietly learned to tolerate?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 2569,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What do you complain about repeatedly and never change?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 2667,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What true thing about your life would be unbearable to say out loud?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 2765,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Five years out, nothing changes. Describe an ordinary Tuesday.",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 2863,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Ten years out, same trajectory. Which doors have closed for good?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 2961,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "At the end of your life, what did you never once attempt?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3059,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av7",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Which identity would you have to stop defending in order to change?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3157,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "av8",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What is the embarrassing, real reason you have not changed yet?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3255,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "vision-q",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Vision Questions**",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 3459,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "vq1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Three years out, best realistic case. Describe an ordinary Tuesday in detail.",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3353,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "vq2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What would you have to believe about yourself for that life to feel normal?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3451,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "vq3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "If you were already that person, what would you do this week?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3549,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "part2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Part 2 — Throughout the Day: Pattern Interruption**\n\nSix alarms that catch you mid-behaviour, plus three questions to carry around.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 4064,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "reminders",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Phone reminders**",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 3884,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1100",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`11:00` What am I avoiding right now?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3647,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1330",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`13:30` Judging only by my behaviour today, what would a stranger say I want?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3729,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1515",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`15:15` Is this moving me toward the life I want or the one I dread?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3827,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1700",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`17:00` What important thing am I pretending is not important?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 3925,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1930",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`19:30` Today, what did I do to protect my image rather than to get what I want?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4023,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2100",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`21:00` When did I feel most alive today? Most dead?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4121,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "contemplation",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Carry-around questions**",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 4301,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "cq1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What changes if I stop needing people to see me as ______?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4203,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "cq2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Where am I trading aliveness for safety?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4301,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "cq3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "What is the smallest version of my future self I could be tomorrow?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4383,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "part3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Part 3 — Evening: Synthesis**\n\nTurn the day's raw material into two sentences and three goals.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 4765,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "integration",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Integration questions**",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 4620,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "iq1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Why, specifically, have you been stuck?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4481,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "iq2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Name the internal enemy: which pattern or belief is actually running this?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4563,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "iq3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "One sentence: what you refuse to let your life become.",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4661,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "iq4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "One sentence: what you are building toward.",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4759,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "goals",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Goal setting — lenses, not finish lines**",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 4947,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "g1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1 year: what would have to be true for you to know the pattern is broken?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4841,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "g2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1 month: what must be true this month to keep the 1-year goal possible?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 4939,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "g3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Daily: which 2–3 actions would your future self simply do, without debate?",
   "x": 1580,
   "y": 5037,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "implementation",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Implementation: Turn Life Into a Game**",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 5646,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "six-components",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Six Components to Document**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 5380,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-anti-vision",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Anti-vision\n\nThe life you refuse to end up in.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5135,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-vision",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Vision\n\nThe life you are building toward.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5233,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-year-goal",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1-year goal\n\nWhat is true twelve months from now.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5315,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-month-project",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1-month project\n\nThe skill to acquire or the thing to build.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5413,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-daily-levers",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Daily levers\n\nThe 2–3 tasks that actually move it.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5511,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-constraints",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Constraints\n\nWhat you will not sacrifice to get it.",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5609,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "game-mechanics",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Game Mechanics**",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 5928,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "gm-vision",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Vision = the win condition",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5707,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "gm-anti",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Anti-vision = what is at stake if you lose",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5789,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "gm-year",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1-year goal = the main mission",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5887,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "gm-month",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1-month project = the boss fight",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 5969,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "gm-levers",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Daily levers = daily quests",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 6051,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "gm-constraints",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Constraints = the rules that force creativity",
   "x": 1150,
   "y": 6133,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 72,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "insights",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Critical Insights**",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 6589,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 56,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "ci-tension",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Change is sudden, but only after tension builds\n\nDissonance leads to uncertainty, uncertainty leads to discovery.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 6231,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "ci-clarity",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Clarity compresses time, hours do not\n\nYou cannot make six years of progress in six months without knowing exactly what you are aiming at.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 6371,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "ci-full-day",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "This takes one full day of focused work\n\nHalf-doing it produces half-answers.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 6511,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 93,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "ci-chapter",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "It lands differently depending on your chapter\n\nTiming is part of the result. The same questions hit harder at some points in life than others.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 6630,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 135,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "ci-questioning",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Questioning is thinking\n\nMost of what passes for thinking is rehearsing things you already believe.",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 6791,
   "width": 270,
